II.C.2. Immersed Vorticity
The force along each blade is introduced back into the fluid domain by converting it into an equivalent immersed vorticity. The aerodynamic loading is first converted into a circulation distribution Γ using the Kutta-Joukowski theorem as
Γ = cVlocal
